The addition order is offsets 16, 8, 4, 2, then 1. At each stage, the shuffle obtains the partner’s pre-addition accumulator, and the caller adds its own accumulator first and the partner’s second using round-to-nearest addition. The final shuffle copies lane zero’s completed result to every caller.

